@startuml
title A1 - Plan vehicle redistribution among Hubs (UC-M4-01, FR-10.1 to FR-10.3)
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
start
:Read snapshot and demand forecast (as_of);
:Compute effective vehicles, expected pickups and returns,\nneed and surplus for every Hub (per vehicle type);
if (Any Hub with need > 0 and any Hub with surplus > 0?) then (no)
  :Report "no task needed";
  stop
endif
:Sort destinations by urgency (highest first), then Hub ID;
while (Destinations left?) is (yes)
  :Take the next destination d;
  while (need(d) > 0 and a source with surplus exists?) is (yes)
    :Pick source s: nearest, then largest surplus, then Hub ID;
    :q = min(need(d), surplus(s), free spaces(d) - buffer, max per task);
    if (q > 0, s keeps its safety stock,\nper-Hub task limit not reached?) then (yes)
      :Select q vehicles at s (Available, battery OK,\nno reservation soon, not in another task);
      if (Enough vehicles?) then (yes)
        :Create DispatchTask (Recommended) with reason;\nupdate need, surplus and free spaces;
      else (no)
        :Reduce q to the vehicles found, or drop the pair;
      endif
    else (no)
      :Drop the pair (s, d);
    endif
  endwhile (no)
endwhile (no)
:Sort tasks (priority, then task key) and show them to the Operator;
stop
@enduml
